Description: Open-source virtual secondary displays for Linux
 Orbiscreen creates a real virtual display via DisplayLink's evdi kernel
 module and streams it as MPEG-TS/H.264 over HTTP to Android tablets and
 phones over Wi-Fi or USB (adb reverse). The evdi framebuffer is the
 primary frame source; the native Wayland path uses the xdg-desktop-portal
 ScreenCast interface and the X11 path uses x11rb GetImage as fallback.
 .
 This package does NOT install the evdi kernel module. See the README for
 module install instructions; Secure Boot systems will need a signed DKMS
 module.